   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Consider the promotions that you have participated in. List them and the product that they were used to promote. Did you buy the product based on the promotion? If you did, what was the selling point? If you did not, where did it miss the mark? Pick a product that you are familiar with, and create a promotion aimed at the consumer.",
